    "provider_api_host": "https://api.thetradedesk.com",
    "_provider_api_note": "Story 28.2: The Trade Desk REST API v3 (MyReports aggregated-reporting domain) is pinned HERE and only here; api_catalog.json / catalog_sources.json api_version must equal this pin. Auth = POST /v3/authentication {Login, Password} -> TTD-Auth token (+ ExpirationDateUtc); the platform credentials are the THETRADEDESK_API_LOGIN / THETRADEDESK_API_PASSWORD env vars (never per-user, never in the manifest); THETRADEDESK_PARTNER_ID scopes discovery. MyReports is NOT create-on-the-fly: the connector references a PRE-EXISTING managed ReportTemplate. STATUS DRAFT until the live probe (public_catalog.verification blocked). Manifest field_ids are the TTD column ids (Impressions, CampaignId, ...) == the api_catalog field_ids; canonical_*_mapping renames them to snake_case at transform/landing (AD-2).",
