    "account_topology": {
        "_comment": "Story 28.2 (pattern 25.5): The Trade Desk hierarchy = Partner -> Advertiser -> Campaign -> AdGroup -> Creative. The reporting entity (selection_level) is the ADVERTISER (MyReports executions are queried per advertiser). discover_accounts = POST /v3/advertiser/query/partner with THETRADEDESK_PARTNER_ID (the partner seat the platform credential is scoped to); every advertiser node carries the composite opaque id '<PartnerId>:<AdvertiserId>' so later calls carry both without re-discovery. Core owns selection/access-check/trial/backfill; THETRADEDESK_*_ID account env vars are FORBIDDEN (doctrine); THETRADEDESK_PARTNER_ID is the partner seat only.",
        "levels": [
